jsx)("span",{className:t3,id:"42-how-can-i-delete-the-content-i-created-on-my-online-whiteboard",children:"How can I delete the content I created on my online whiteboard?"}),(0,s.jsx)(t0.k,{className:t4})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["To delete any content or objects from your online whiteboard, select the item you want to delete, then right-click and hit Delete or use the Delete button on your keyboard. To delete an entire board, go to your Figma files, navigate to the Drafts tab, right-click the whiteboard you want to delete, and then hit Delete."," "]})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("details",{className:t5,children:[" ",(0,s.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("span",{className:t3,id:"44-can-i-access-the-virtual-whiteboard-again-at-a-later-point",children:"Can I access the virtual whiteboard again at a later point?"}),(0,s.jsx)(t0.k,{className:t4})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["Your virtual whiteboard is saved and ready for you to access at any time. When looking for a board, go to your Figma files, and look for your board under the Drafts tab. You can also type the board name into the search bar to find the board you\u2019re looking for."," "]})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("details",{className:t5,children:[" ",(0,s.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("span",{className:t3,id:"45-how-can-i-create-an-identical-copy-of-my-online-whiteboard",children:"How can I create an identical copy of my online whiteboard?"}),(0,s.jsx)(t0.k,{className:t4})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["To duplicate and make a copy of your whiteboard, navigate to the menu bar in the top left corner. Click the dropdown arrow next to the whiteboard title, then click Duplicate. This will make a duplicate copy of your board and automatically save it to your drafts."," "]})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("details",{className:t5,children:[" ",(0,s.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("span",{className:t3,id:"46-how-do-i-share-an-online-whiteboard",children:"How do I share an online whiteboard?"}),(0,s.jsx)(t0.k,{className:t4})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["The easiest way to share your online whiteboard is to send collaborators a share link. Click the Share button at the top right corner of your whiteboard, then select the Copy button. You can also invite additional collaborators via email, which you\u2019ll find via the same Share button."," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["If you\u2019d like to allow collaborators to edit your whiteboard, update the permission settings to \u201CCan edit.\u201D This allows other team members to move, edit, and add objects to the board while giving them access to other FigJam collaboration features like running voting sessions or starting timers."," "]})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("details",{className:t5,children:[" ",(0,s.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("span",{className:t3,id:"48-how-do-i-export-my-online-whiteboards",children:"How do I export my online whiteboards?"}),(0,s.jsx)(t0.k,{className:t4})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["To export your online whiteboards, click the Figma icon on the menu bar in the top left corner, then navigate to File and click Export as. From there, you\u2019ll have the option to export your board as a PNG, JPG, PDF, or CSV. You can also choose a solid, grid, or transparent background when exporting the file, but options may differ depending on the file type."," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["If you only want to export a portion of your board, select the items you want to export, then right-click and choose Export selection."," "]})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("details",{className:t5,children:[" ",(0,s.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("span",{className:t3,id:"49-can-other-users-export-my-online-whiteboards",children:"Can other users export my online whiteboards?"}),(0,s.jsx)(t0.k,{className:t4})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["Other users can export your online whiteboards if they have editing access. To check your access permissions, click the Share button in the top right corner of your whiteboard and change the edit toggle on for any team member you\u2019d like to grant editing access."," "]})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("details",{className:t5,children:[" ",(0,s.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("span",{className:t3,id:"50-how-can-other-people-collaborate-on-the-whiteboard",children:"How can other people collaborate on the whiteboard?"}),(0,s.jsx)(t0.k,{className:t4})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["FigJam\u2019s online whiteboard offers tons of collaboration features to get your whole team involved. Some collaboration features to explore include:"," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("ul",{children:[(0,s.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("strong",{children:"Comments, mentions, and chat."})," Use the comment feature to ask questions or provide feedback anywhere on the board. Use the @ symbol to tag other collaborators and type a message in the selected field. You can also add media to a comment by dragging and dropping a file or clicking the image icon."," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("strong",{children:"Stamps, emotes, and high-fives."})," Offer visual feedback to team members with these features. Click anywhere on the board and use the stamp tool to leave a sticker of your choice, or select the emote tool to leave temporary emoji reactions."," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("strong",{children:"Cursor chat."})," This feature is great for quick communication, allowing you to leave live, temporary messages to other collaborators. When cursor chat is on, your chat bubble will appear next to your cursor and team members can see your message as you\u2019re typing."," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("strong",{children:"Audio call."})," FigJam\u2019s audio feature is great for quick conversations and casual chats during meetings. Click the headphone icon next to your profile avatar, then click Start Conversation. Any collaborators with access to the board can join live conversations by clicking the same icon."," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("strong",{children:"Spotlight."})," This feature allows any collaborators to see your view of the board, which is helpful when running quick audio calls for meetings and workshops. Hover over your avatar, then click Spotlight Me, and an invitation will be sent to any collaborator viewing the file."]})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["Collaborators with view access can use most of these collaboration features, but if you\u2019d like to give anyone the ability to move, add, or edit objects on the whiteboard or have access to Community resources like stickers and libraries, make sure your users\u2019 access is set to \u201CCan edit.\u201D"," "]})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("details",{className:t5,children:[" ",(0,s.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("span",{className:t3,id:"51-can-other-users-draw-on-and-edit-the-contents-of-the-online-whiteboard",children:"Can other users draw on and edit the contents of the online whiteboard?"}),(0,s.jsx)(t0.k,{className:t4})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["Yes! Anyone with editing access can use FigJam\u2019s drawing tools and edit, move, or change the order of objects on the whiteboard. Collaborators can also use features like stamps and emotes to leave visual feedback and reactions to content on the whiteboard."," "]})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("details",{className:t5,children:[" ",(0,s.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("span",{className:t3,id:"52-can-others-edit-my-virtual-whiteboard",children:"Can others edit my virtual whiteboard?"}),(0,s.jsx)(t0.k,{className:t4})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["Yes! If you\u2019d like to invite other collaborators to edit your online whiteboard, send them a share link or invite them via email. Check your permission settings and make sure collaborators have \u201CCan edit\u201D access, allowing them to edit, move, and rearrange any objects on your board."," "]})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("details",{className:t5,children:[" ",(0,s.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("span",{className:t3,id:"53-how-can-others-view-my-figjam-online-whiteboard",children:"How can others view my FigJam online whiteboard?"}),(0,s.jsx)(t0.k,{className:t4})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["Share your online whiteboard by sending other people a share link or inviting them via email. Make sure the \u201CCan view\u201D settings are turned on, which also gives viewers access to FigJam\u2019s collaboration features while viewing your board, like adding comments, mentions, or emotes."," "]})]})]})}function t8(){return(0,s.jsxs)("div",{className:t1,children:[(0,s.jsx)("h1",{className:t2,id:"online-whiteboard-templates",children:(0,s.jsx)("strong",{children:"Online whiteboard templates"})}),(0,s.jsxs)("details",{className:t5,children:[(0,s.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("span",{className:t3,id:"54-does-the-online-diagram-tool-offer-ready-made-templates",children:"Does the online diagram tool offer ready-made templates?"}),(0,s.jsx)(t0.k,{className:t4})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["FigJam offers tons of pre-made"," ",(0,s.jsx)(tQ.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/templates/diagramming/",children:"diagramming templates"})," ","that are easy to edit and customize to fit your needs. Browse Figma\u2019s template library to find the one you need or open a diagram template on your whiteboard by clicking the Template button in the top right menu bar."," "]})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("details",{className:t5,children:[(0,s.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("span",{className:t3,id:"55-how-can-i-find-online-whiteboard-templates",children:"How can I find online whiteboard templates?"}),(0,s.jsx)(t0.k,{className:t4})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["To access a template from your whiteboard, click the Plus button at the bottom right of your toolbar. Then, navigate to the templates section to find the template you\u2019re looking for. You can also select the template icon located on the top right menu bar. If you\u2019d like to add a template to a section, click the template icon next to the section title, then browse different templates for team meetings, brainstorms, and more."," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["You can also visit the"," ",(0,s.jsx)(tQ.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/templates/",children:"template library"})," to explore over 300 free templates. Once you\u2019ve found the one you need, click the Start Diagramming or Get Started button to open the template directly in FigJam."," "]})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("details",{className:t5,children:[(0,s.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("span",{className:t3,id:"56-how-do-i-use-a-ready-made-template-on-my-online-whiteboard",children:"How do I use a ready-made template on my online whiteboard?"}),(0,s.jsx)(t0.k,{className:t4})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["To use a pre-made template, click the Plus icon on the bottom toolbar and navigate to the Templates tab to search for or find templates organized by category. You can also click the template icon in the top right corner to quickly browse through ready-made template options."," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["Explore Figma\u2019s online"," ",(0,s.jsx)(tQ.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/templates/",children:"template library"})," to view all of the free templates, from brainstorming and strategic planning to diagramming and meeting planning."," "]})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("details",{className:t5,children:[(0,s.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("span",{className:t3,id:"57-what-are-some-popular-online-whiteboard-templates",children:"What are some popular online whiteboard templates?"}),(0,s.jsx)(t0.k,{className:t4})]}),(0,s.jsx)("p",{children:"You can kickstart your ideas with hundreds of free online whiteboard templates. Some of the most popular ones include:"}),(0,s.jsxs)("ul",{children:[(0,s.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,s.jsx)(tQ.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/templates/project-kickoff-template/",children:"Project kickoff template"})," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,s.jsx)(tQ.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/templates/flow-chart-template/",children:"Flowchart template"})," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,s.jsx)(tQ.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/templates/team-meeting-agenda-template/",children:"Team meeting template"})," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,s.jsx)(tQ.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/templates/customer-journey-map/",children:"Customer journey map template"})," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,s.jsx)(tQ.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/templates/daily-stand-up-meeting-template/",children:"Standup template"})," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,s.jsx)(tQ.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/templates/project-retrospective-template/",children:"Retrospective template"})," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,s.jsx)(tQ.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/templates/agile-roadmap-template/",children:"Roadmap review template"})," "]}),(0,s.jsx)("li",{children:(0,s.jsx)(tQ.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/templates/timeline-template/",children:"Project timeline template"})})]})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("details",{className:t5,children:[(0,s.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("span",{className:t3,id:"58-how-can-i-copy-a-flowchart-on-figjams-online-whiteboard",children:"How can I copy a flowchart on FigJam\u2019s online whiteboard?"}),(0,s.jsx)(t0.k,{className:t4})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["To copy a FigJam flowchart, drag your cursor around the entire flowchart, right-click, and then hit Group selection or Command + G on your keyboard. This will ensure your entire flowchart is grouped, making it easier to copy. Once you\u2019ve made your selection, click the flowchart and hit Command + C on your keyboard or right-click and hit Copy."," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["If you want to copy individual objects or symbols on your flowchart, click the item you want to copy and hit Command + C on your keyboard, or right-click and hit Copy."," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["You can also make a copy of your flowchart for others to use by adding it to the"," ",(0,s.jsx)(tQ.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/community/",children:"Figma Community"}),". To do this, click the Share button in the top right corner of your board, then click Publish to Community. You must have \u201CCan edit\u201D access to publish the file to the Community."," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:[(0,s.jsx)(tQ.N,{href:"https://help.figma.com/hc/articles/360040035974-Publish-files-to-the-Community",children:"Learn more about how to publish files to the Figma Community"}),"."," "]})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("details",{className:t5,children:[(0,s.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("span",{className:t3,id:"59-can-i-create-a-flowchart-with-specific-symbols-on-my-online-whiteboard",children:"Can I create a flowchart with specific symbols on my online whiteboard?"}),(0,s.jsx)(t0.k,{className:t4})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["Absolutely! Flowchart symbols are shapes, lines, and arrows that represent actions or processes on your flowchart diagram. For example, a diamond shape symbolizes points where decisions are made, rectangles signify a specific action or step needed to carry out a process, and parallelograms show where users input or output data."," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["FigJam\u2019s online whiteboard has over 20 shapes and symbols you can use to build a flowchart that maps user flows, systems, and processes. Read FigJam\u2019s"," ",(0,s.jsx)(tQ.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/resource-library/flowchart-symbols/",children:"flowchart symbol guide"})," ","to learn more about what each symbol means and how to effectively use them."," "]})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("details",{className:t5,children:[(0,s.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("span",{className:t3,id:"60-do-i-have-to-start-my-work-with-the-ready-made-online-flowchart",children:"Do I have to start my work with the ready-made online flowchart?"}),(0,s.jsx)(t0.k,{className:t4})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["You can start your flowchart with ready-made templates or start from scratch and build your own using shapes, lines, and connectors on the FigJam whiteboard. You can also use FigJam\u2019s Generate tool, which uses the power of AI to create a customized flowchart based on the prompt you input."," "]})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("details",{className:t5,children:[(0,s.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("span",{className:t3,id:"61-can-i-add-sticky-notes-to-my-flowchart-board",children:"Can I add sticky notes to my flowchart board?"}),(0,s.jsx)(t0.k,{className:t4})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["You can add sticky notes anywhere on your board when building a flowchart. Press S on your keyboard or click the stack of stickies on the bottom toolbar, then click the area of your flowchart where you\u2019d like to drop the sticky."," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["You can also add connectors between sticky notes to visualize flows and create paths. Click the connector icon on the toolbar, or hit Shift + C to create an elbow connector or L for a straight line. Then, click and drag your cursor between the stickies you want to connect."," "]})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("details",{className:t5,children:[(0,s.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("span",{className:t3,id:"62-can-i-add-text-to-my-flowchart",children:"Can I add text to my flowchart?"}),(0,s.jsx)(t0.k,{className:t4})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["Shapes already come with the option to add text, making it easy to add text and labels when"," ",(0,s.jsx)(tQ.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/resource-library/how-to-create-a-flow-chart/",children:"building your flowchart"}),". When resizing a shape, use the text option in the toolbar to adjust the text or make any other formatting changes to enhance readability."," "]})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("details",{className:t5,children:[(0,s.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("span",{className:t3,id:"63-can-i-undoredo-something-on-my-flowchart",children:"Can I undo/redo something on my flowchart?"}),(0,s.jsx)(t0.k,{className:t4})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["Of course! To undo something on your flowchart, hit Command + Z on your keyboard. Or, navigate to the main menu in the upper left corner, click the Figma symbol, edit, and select undo. If you want to delete an object on your flowchart, hit the Delete button on your keyboard or right-click the flowchart object and hit Delete."," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["To redo something, click Shift + Command + Z on your keyboard or select edit, then redo on the main menu."," "]})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("details",{className:t5,children:[(0,s.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("span",{className:t3,id:"64-how-do-i-connect-shapes-and-symbols-on-my-flowchart-online",children:"How do I connect shapes and symbols on my flowchart online?"}),(0,s.jsx)(t0.k,{className:t4})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["Use lines and connectors located on the bottom toolbar to connect shapes and symbols on your flowchart. Lines automatically snap onto the shapes and stickies you select, allowing you to move the object around the board without disrupting the connector."," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["To speed up the flowchart process, use"," ",(0,s.jsx)(tQ.N,{href:"https://help.figma.com/hc/articles/1500004291601-Build-faster-with-quick-create-in-FigJam#Quick_create_shapes",children:"quick create"})," ","to automatically connect shapes as you\u2019re creating them."," "]})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("details",{className:t5,children:[(0,s.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("span",{className:t3,id:"65-what-is-the-meaning-of-the-flowchart-symbols",children:"What is the meaning of the flowchart symbols?"}),(0,s.jsx)(t0.k,{className:t4})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["Flowchart symbols visually represent each step, action, or order in a process. Every symbol has a different meaning, making it easier for teams to understand and analyze processes."," "]}),(0,s.jsx)("p",{children:"The most common flowchart symbols are: "}),(0,s.jsxs)("ul",{children:[(0,s.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("strong",{children:"Decision:"})," a diamond shape to represent any point where a decision is made"," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("strong",{children:"Action:"})," a rectangle shape to symbolize any step or action in a process"," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("strong",{children:"Terminator:"})," an oval symbol marking the first and last step in a process"," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("strong",{children:"Input/output:"})," a parallelogram to show when data enters or leaves"," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("strong",{children:"Directional flow:"})," arrows and lines representing the directional path between steps or actions"]})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["FigJam\u2019s online whiteboard tool comes with all the shapes, symbols, and connectors you need to build even the most complex flowcharts."," "]})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("details",{className:t5,children:[(0,s.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("span",{className:t3,id:"66-what-flowchart-symbols-are-available",children:"What flowchart symbols are available?"}),(0,s.jsx)(t0.k,{className:t4})]}),(0,s.jsx)("p",{children:"Some of the available flowchart symbols FigJam offers include: "}),(0,s.jsxs)("ul",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("li",{children:"Predefined process "}),(0,s.jsx)("li",{children:"Document "}),(0,s.jsx)("li",{children:"Multiple documents "}),(0,s.jsx)("li",{children:"Manual input "}),(0,s.jsx)("li",{children:"Hexagon "}),(0,s.jsx)("li",{children:"Right-leaning parallelogram "}),(0,s.jsx)("li",{children:"Left-leaning parallelogram "}),(0,s.jsx)("li",{children:"Cylinder "}),(0,s.jsx)("li",{children:"Horizontal cylinder "}),(0,s.jsx)("li",{children:"Internal storage "}),(0,s.jsx)("li",{children:"Trapezoid "}),(0,s.jsx)("li",{children:"Summing junction "}),(0,s.jsx)("li",{children:"Or "}),(0,s.jsx)("li",{children:"Shield "}),(0,s.jsx)("li",{children:"Folder "}),(0,s.jsx)("li",{children:"File"})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["To explore the flowchart symbols FigJam offers, click the shapes on the bottom toolbar, then click Flowchart on the dropdown menu."," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:[(0,s.jsx)(tQ.N,{href:"https://help.figma.com/hc/articles/1500004414382-Visualize-information-using-shapes-with-text",children:"Learn more about visualizing information and building flowcharts with shapes"}),"."," "]})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("details",{className:t5,children:[(0,s.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("span",{className:t3,id:"67-how-can-i-access-additional-flowcharting-features",children:"How can I access additional flowcharting features?"}),(0,s.jsx)(t0.k,{className:t4})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["Aside from building using pre-made flowchart templates or building your own flowchart with shapes and symbols, FigJam\u2019s AI feature allows you to generate customized flowcharts in seconds."," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["In the top toolbar, click Generate, then choose Flowchart and add a prompt to specify any unique symbols or features you\u2019d like to add to your diagram. The more specific, the better. Once you\u2019ve nailed your prompt, hit the Generate button and watch the magic happen."," "]})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("details",{className:t5,children:[(0,s.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("span",{className:t3,id:"68-will-i-know-who-made-changes-to-my-online-flowchart",children:"Will I know who made changes to my online flowchart?"}),(0,s.jsx)(t0.k,{className:t4})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["To see who\u2019s made changes to your online flowchart, click File, then View version history in the upper left corner of your board. From there, you can see who\u2019s made changes to the flowchart and when."," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["To revert any changes and restore a version of your flowchart, click the three dots next to the autosaved version, then hit Restore this version. You can also name each version to make it easier to track any changes made."," "]})]})]})}function t9(){return(0,s.jsxs)("div",{className:t1,children:[(0,s.jsx)("h1",{className:t2,id:"using-your-online-whiteboard",children:(0,s.jsx)("strong",{children:"Using your online whiteboard"})}),(0,s.jsxs)("details",{className:t5,children:[(0,s.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("span",{className:t3,id:"1-what-is-an-online-whiteboard",children:"What is an online whiteboard?"}),(0,s.jsx)(t0.k,{className:t4})]}),(0,s.jsx)("p",{children:"An online whiteboard is a visual collaboration tool for teams that recreates the feeling of working together in person."}),(0,s.jsx)("p",{children:"Unlike digital documents or slides, online whiteboards provide teams space to think outside the constraints of margins and text boxes. Plus, you can express yourself and interact with teammates live on the board, making conversations more human, dynamic, and productive."})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("details",{className:t5,children:[(0,s.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("span",{className:t3,id:"2-what-is-figjam",children:"What is FigJam?"}),(0,s.jsx)(t0.k,{className:t4})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["FigJam is an online whiteboard tool that offers an easy way for individuals, teams, and organizations to collaborate on projects like brainstorming, project planning, design, and meetings. With its easy-to-use collaboration features, FigJam encourages users to contribute, offer feedback, and engage with team members in real time."," "]})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("details",{className:t5,children:[(0,s.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("span",{className:t3,id:"3-is-figjams-online-whiteboard-tool-free",children:"Is FigJam's online whiteboard tool free?"})," ",(0,s.jsx)(t0.k,{className:t4})," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["FigJam is an online whiteboard that can be used for free forever with unlimited collaborators in three editable files. Paid plans start at just $5 per user per month, less than a third of the cost of Miro and Mural."," ",(0,s.jsx)(tQ.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/figjam-vs-miro/",children:"Compare FigJam to Miro"}),"."]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["To learn more about FigJam plans, visit the"," ",(0,s.jsx)(tQ.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/pricing/#figjam",children:"pricing page"}),"."," "]})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("details",{className:t5,children:[(0,s.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("span",{className:t3,id:"4-are-online-whiteboards-only-for-brainstorming",children:"Are online whiteboards only for brainstorming?"}),(0,s.jsx)(t0.k,{className:t4})," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["Collaborative online whiteboards like FigJam make all types of activities more inclusive, productive, and fun, including"," ",(0,s.jsx)(tQ.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/figjam/diagramming-tool/",children:"diagramming"}),", journey mapping,"," ",(0,s.jsx)(tQ.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/figjam/strategic-planning/",children:"strategic planning"}),","," ",(0,s.jsx)(tQ.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/figjam/agile-workflows/",children:"agile workflows"}),", and facilitating ",(0,s.jsx)(tQ.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/figjam/team-meetings/",children:"team meetings"})," ","and workshops."]})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("details",{className:t5,children:[(0,s.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("span",{className:t3,id:"5-can-i-make-online-presentations-with-figjam",children:"Can I make online presentations with FigJam?"}),(0,s.jsx)(t0.k,{className:t4})," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["While FigJam isn't a traditional presentation tool, its interactive features make it a great tool for presenting ideas and engaging in conversations with teams. Whether you're holding a design retrospective or brainstorming session, you can invite team members to view and follow your board using the Spotlight and audio call feature."," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:[(0,s.jsx)(tQ.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/slides/",children:"Learn more about creating presentations with Figma Slides"}),"."," "]})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("details",{className:t5,children:[(0,s.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("span",{className:t3,id:"6-can-i-use-the-online-whiteboard-to-take-meeting-notes",children:"Can I use the online whiteboard to take meeting notes?"}),(0,s.jsx)(t0.k,{className:t4})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["Yes. Use sticky notes, shapes, or text boxes to add your thoughts. Format your text using a bulleted or numbered list, then use the marker or highlighter to draw attention to important information."," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["FigJam's"," ",(0,s.jsx)(tQ.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/templates/meeting-notes-template/",children:"meeting notes template"})," ","is a great starting point for jotting down important takeaways and organizing your notes."," "]})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("details",{className:t5,children:[(0,s.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("span",{className:t3,id:"7-can-i-use-the-online-whiteboard-for-personal-projects",children:"Can I use the online whiteboard for personal projects?"})," ",(0,s.jsx)(t0.k,{className:t4})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["Yes! FigJam is a free tool to use for personal, professional, or educational projects. Since the online whiteboard is so versatile, it's easy to use for various personal projects or tasks like organizing weekly tasks, studying for exams, setting goals, or journaling your thoughts."," "]})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("details",{className:t5,children:[(0,s.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,s.jsx)("span",{className:t3,id:"8-can-i-use-figjam-digital-whiteboards-with-conferencing-platforms",children:"Can I use FigJam digital whiteboards with conferencing platforms?"})," ",(0,s.jsx)(t0.k,{className:t4})]}),(0,s.jsxs)("p",{children:["FigJam integrates with many popular conferencing platforms to make it easy to present your whiteboard without leaving your conferencing tool. Learn more about how to integrate FigJam with the following platforms:"," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("ul",{children:[(0,s.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,s.jsx)(tQ.N,{href:"https://help.figma.com/hc/articles/17720082601751-Figma-and-Zoom",children:"FigJam and Zoom"})," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,s.jsx)(tQ.N,{href:"https://help.figma.com/hc/articles/16921722048151-Figma-and-Google-Meet",children:"FigJam and Google Meet"})," "]}),(0,s.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,s.jsx)(tQ.N,{href:"https://help.figma.com/hc/articles/7405452518423-Figma-and-Microsoft-Teams",children:"FigJam and Microsoft Teams"})," "]}),(0,s.jsx)("li",{children:(0,s.jsx)(tQ.N,{href:"https://help.figma.com/hc/articles/1500002613622-P2-and-